IstafelsSunfireGrasp: {
	RarityLabel: Legendary
	DisplayName: Istafels Sunfire Grasp
	Tooltip:
		'''
		{0}% increased magic damage and {1}% increased magic critical strike chance
		Magic hits build up Burn equal to {2}% of damage dealt
		With no fireball cooldown, magic hits create floating slag and add one-third of damage dealt as charge, rounded down per hit
		Every 2 seconds, floating slag fires a 50-base-damage homing fireball at a visible target within 125 tiles
		Charge above {3} launches the slag and starts a {4}-second fireball cooldown
		Slag and scoria contact hits add {5} flat final damage and inflict Charred for {6} seconds
		Slag hits create a 200-base-damage explosion and 8–9 pieces of scoria
		Charred: {7} life lost per second and {8}% reduced defense
		Press the accessory skill key to apply the remaining damage of flame debuffs and Charred on enemies within {9} tiles
		For {10} seconds afterward, deal {11}% increased final damage to enemies with those flame debuffs; {12}-second skill cooldown
		'''
}

